This has 9 parameters, many of which are pre-computed on the handler struct (h.ctx, h.repo, h.shadowBranchName). The struct exists to bundle these together, but the method still takes them individually.

**Suggested fix:** Consider passing the entire handler to the method instead:
```go
// Instead of many individual parameters:
h.condensed = h.s.condenseAndUpdateStateForHandler(h, h.checkpointID, state, h.committedFileSet)

